      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The service-formed oxide layer will be continuous and adherent.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced oxide-former content causes rapid generation of a protective oxide scale during combined high-temperature tribological and corrosive exposure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A protective oxide layer can increase the elevated-temperature wear resistance of an AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 alloy under atmospheric reciprocating wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide scale acts as a self-healing barrier.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide barrier reduces both mechanical wear and corrosion progression.",
