        "PMC9955357::chunk::000::abstract::094b212c37"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "AlCoCrFeNi2.1 has a lower molten chloride-salt corrosion rate than duplex stainless steel 2205 at 450 °C and 650 °C.",
